# Camp Blackwater's boathouse cellar (CIPlay camp_blackwater_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe (the origin frame): kit_st mouth at 43.5 47 (yaw 35: way in = +x +z), tunnel 7.3 m, the den ~22 m on
# (centre ~54 62, on the pad flattened to 3 m); the sign cbcellarsign at 36 42; the hidden strongroom hatch cbcellarhatch at
# 55 63.5 and chest cbcellarchest at 56 64.8; two rats; zone cb_cellar at 50.5 56.5. Floor ~3 m (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (the cave hill may move the land centre).
island Camp Blackwater keep
offset -0.4374 -1.2402
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden cbcellarhatch
expect hidden cbcellarchest

# The knoll and the mouth from the boathouse path
picture cb_cellar_out 34 +3 38 43.5 +1.5 47
picture cb_cellar_side 52 +4 40 43.5 +1.5 47
read BOATHOUSE CELLAR

# The rats in the cellar (11-12 mixed monsters): alive, inside the cave
wait 3
expect animals Rat 2
expect animalsinside Rat 2
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0

# In along the tunnel to the den
walk 36 41 to 43.5 47 to 47.5 52.7 to 51 57.5 to 54 62
zone cb_cellar
picture cb_cellar_in 46 +2.5 51 54 +0.5 62 light=20

# The hatch is hidden until Counsellor Shogo's third answer, then locked till talked: he is talked by the pick
use Counsellor Shogo pick 3
expect message Your funeral
expect shown cbcellarhatch
use cbcellarhatch
expect hidden cbcellarhatch
expect shown cbcellarchest
open Camp strongroom
picture cb_cellar_chest 52 +2.5 60 56 +0.5 64.8 light=20

# Out again
walk 54 62 to 51 57.5 to 47.5 52.7 to 43.5 47 to 36 41
